/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 480 0 R
/E (DMARC Alignment Failure : Although the attacker used a legitimate-looking "From" address \(newsletter.otto.de\), the email failed DMARC validation. This is because the "Envelope From" \(the actual return address\) was granigo.art. In a secure mail system, the header domain and the envelope domain must match \(alignment\); since they did not, the email was flagged as a forgery.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [23]
>>
